ommon-china-bag-making-machine-issues"}}},{"id":"u2aYZgT33lk549eVcvoCX3bMJx6cgFcn","function":{"index":1,"name":"fetch_url","arguments":{"url":"https://www.dahepowderfiller.com/resources/the-common-issues-and-solutions-of-bag-making-machine.html"}}},{"id":"x5mzFn9lFBfi3TbEEF8qaEBGj0wCp8FD","function":{"index":2,"name":"fetch_url","arguments":{"url":"https://www.toplusse.com/blog/bag-machine-troubleshooting-guide-common-issues"}}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":"Troubleshooting Tips for Common China Bag Making Machine Issues | CHOVYTING We use cookies to improve your browsing experience. By continuing to usethis website, you agree to our use of cookies. Accept All  |  Decline All Skip to content \n +8613958813143 \n [email protected] \n Search \n Facebook-f \n Youtube \n Tiktok \n Home Products Plastic Bag Making Machine Side sealing bag making machine Bottom sealing bag making machine Rolling garbage bag Vest bag making machine Laminated Pouch Making Machine Series FFS Industry Heavy Duty Bag Making Machine Series Auxiliary equipment About R&D Videos Service Blog Solution Projects Franchise Contact \n INDUSTRY NEWS \n Home\n Blog\n Industry News \n May 25, 2026 \n Troubleshooting Tips for Common China Bag Making Machine Issues With the rapid growth of the global packaging industry, more manufacturers are choosing high-speed China bag making machines to improve production efficiency and reduce manufacturing costs. These machines are widely used for producing shopping bags, courier bags, garbage bags, zipper pouches, food packaging bags, and industrial heavy-duty packaging bags. However, during long-term high-speed production, factories often encounter problems such as poor sealing, inaccurate bag length, film deviation, servo motor alarms, unstable cutting, and excessive material waste. If these issues are not solved quickly, they can lead to production downtime, increased operating costs, and customer complaints. In this article, we will discuss the most common China bag making machine issues, their causes, troubleshooting methods, and preventive maintenance solutions. Whether you operate a side sealing bag making machine, bottom sealing bag making machine, wicket bag machine, pouch making machine, or FFS heavy-duty bag making machine, this guide can help improve production stability and machine lifespan. Why Troubleshooting Is Important in Modern Bag Making Machines Manufacturing Modern plastic bag production lines operate at extremely high speeds. Some advanced high speed bag making machines can now reach over 500 pcs/min, while multi-line systems can exceed 2000 pcs/min output capacity. Under these conditions, even a small machine problem may lead to serious production losses.   Common Production Risks ● Bag sealing defects \n● Printing position errors \n● Film feeding instability \n● Bag length inconsistency \n● Servo synchronization failures \n● Material waste increase \n● Production downtime Factories that perform effective troubleshooting and preventive maintenance can significantly improve machine stability, product quality, and operational efficiency. Common Sealing Problems in China Bag Making Machines Bag sealing quality directly affects the strength, appearance, and usability of plastic packaging bags. Poor sealing is one of the most common issues in plastic bag production. Why Is the Bag Not Sealing Properly? Several factors can cause weak or incomplete sealing: ● Incorrect sealing temperature \n● Uneven sealing pressure \n● Damaged heating elements \n● Low-quality plastic film \n● Excessive production speed \n● Worn sealing knife When sealing temperature is too low, the film layers cannot fully bond together. On the other hand, excessive temperature may burn the film and cause wrinkles or deformation. How to Troubleshoot Sealing Problems Step 1: Check Temperature Settings Verify whether the sealing temperature matches the film material. Film Material Recommended Temperature HDPE 140–180°C LDPE 120–160°C PP Film 160–220°C Laminated Film Depends on layer structure Step 2: Inspect Sealing Knife A worn or contaminated sealing knife often causes poor sealing consistency. Check for: ● Carbon buildup \n● Knife surface damage \n● Uneven pressure \n● Incorrect knife alignment Step 3: Adjust Machine Speed High-speed production may reduce sealing time. Lowering machine speed slightly can improve sealing quality. Bag Length Inaccuracy During Production Bag length inconsistency is especially common in high-speed side sealing bag making machines and bottom sealing machines. Common Symptoms ● Different bag lengths \n● Misaligned printing \n● Incorrect cutting positions \n● Unstable bag registration Main Causes 1. EPC Alignment Failure The EPC (Edge Position Control) system maintains film alignment during production. If the EPC sensor is dirty or improperly calibrated, film deviation may occur. 2. Servo Synchronization Problems Servo motors control film feeding and cutting accuracy. Incorrect servo parameters may result in unstable bag length. 3. Film Tension Instability Uneven tension stretches the plastic film, changing actual bag dimensions. Troubleshooting Solutions ● Clean EPC sensors daily \n● Recalibrate photoelectric tracking \n● Check servo motor settings \n● Maintain constant film tension \n● Inspect encoder feedback signals Advanced China bag making machines now use intelligent servo algorithms to improve bag length precision during ultra-high-speed production.   Film Feeding and EPC Tracking Problems Film tracking problems can seriously affect bag appearance and production stability. Common Film Feeding Issues ● Film drifting left or right \n● Wrinkled feeding \n● Printing offset \n● Feeding vibration \n● Unstable rewinding Causes of Film Deviation Cause Impact Dirty EPC sensor Inaccurate correction Loose rollers Feeding instability Uneven tension Film wrinkles Poor servo response Printing misalignment Solutions Clean the EPC System Dust or film debris may interfere with sensor detection. Check Roller Parallelism Misaligned rollers can cause continuous film drifting. Stabilize Tension Control Modern automatic bag making machines use servo tension systems to maintain stable film feeding. Servo Motor Alarm Troubleshooting Servo systems are critical components in fully automatic bag making machines. When servo alarms occur, the entire production line may stop immediately. Common Servo Alarm Causes ● Overload operation \n● Voltage fluctuation \n● Encoder communication failure \n● Incorrect PLC parameters \n● Excessive acceleration settings How to Solve Servo Alarms Inspect Electrical Wiring Loose cables or unstable connectors may interrupt communication signals. Reset Servo Parameters Improper acceleration and deceleration settings can overload the servo system. Reduce Production Speed If machine speed exceeds the servo system capacity, overload alarms may occur. Check Encoder Signals Damaged encoders reduce positioning accuracy. Cutting Problems in High-Speed Bag Making Machines Cutting precision is extremely important for high-quality plastic bag production. Common Cutting Problems ● Uneven cutting edges \n● Incorrect cutting position \n● Film tearing \n● Excessive burrs \n● Knife overheating Causes of Cutting Problems Worn Flying Knife Flying knife systems experience wear during long-term high-speed operation. Servo Timing Mismatch Incorrect synchronization between feeding and cutting systems causes inaccurate cuts. Machine Vibration Weak machine structures may reduce cutting stability at high speeds. Why Flying Knife Technology Is Important Modern flying knife bottom sealing bag making machines provide: ● Higher cutting speed \n● Better sealing appearance \n● Reduced waste \n● Improved production stability \n● Better performance during continuous operation Chovyting Machinery has continuously upgraded flying knife technology, achieving significant speed improvements in recent years. Preventive Maintenance Tips for Bag Making Machines Preventive maintenance helps reduce unexpected downtime and extend machine lifespan. Daily Maintenance Checklist ● Clean sealing bars \n● Remove film dust \n● Inspect sensors \n● Lubricate moving parts \n● Check air pressure \n● Monitor heating temperature Weekly Maintenance Maintenance Item Purpose Servo inspection Prevent alarm failures EPC calibration Improve tracking accuracy Roller cleaning Stabilize film feeding Knife inspection Maintain cutting quality Electrical cabinet cleaning Prevent overheating Monthly Maint\n…（共 14787 字，已读到 8000；接着读请用 offset=8000）"},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":"The common issues and solutions of bag making machine \n Tel.: +86 21 5784 1768 \n E-mail: international@dahepack.com \n English \n English \n French \n Italian \n Spanish \n Russian \n Korean \n Arabic \n Filipino \n Japanese \n Bengali \n Polish \n Portuguese \n Thai \n Turkish \n German \n Romanian \n Malay \n Norwegian \n Swedish \n Bulgarian \n Persian \n Urdu \n Indonesian \n Vietnamese \n Home \n About Us \n Products \n Powder Mixer \n Powder Bag Filling Machine \n Powder Cans & Jars Filling Machine \n Multi Head \n Double Head \n Rotary Type \n Economic Liner Type \n Semi Automatic \n Powder Mixing and Filling Line \n Powder Canning Line Machine \n Powder Feeder \n Turn-key Powder Filling Line \n News \n Application \n Contacts \n Home \n About Us \n Products \n Powder Mixer \n Powder Bag Filling Machine \n Powder Cans & Jars Filling Machine \n Multi Head \n Double Head \n Rotary Type \n Economic Liner Type \n Semi Automatic \n Powder Mixing and Filling Line \n Powder Canning Line Machine \n Powder Feeder \n Turn-key Powder Filling Line \n News \n Application \n Contacts \n Home \n > News \n > Resources \n > The common issues and solutions of bag making machine \n The common issues and solutions of bag making machine \n Jun. 26, 2025 \n In today's ever-evolving industry, understanding the importance of Bag Filling Machine troubleshooting is crucial for staying competitive and making informed decisions. This article explores Bag Filling Machine troubleshooting, offering practical insights for businesses and professionals alike.\n The common issues and solutions of bag making machine The common  issues  and solutions of bag making machine When we use the b ag making machine  some failures occur. How do we deal with these issues? Let ’ s introduce to you. Problem : Bag  length （ along machine direction ） may varies time to time when the material is plain. Potential Reasons : 1.  T ension of  servo motor is not well adjusted . 2.  Traction rollers do not drag the material. 3.  Rubber Roller has diameter error Solutio ns 1.  Adjust the change rate of servo tension 2.  Check  whether the rubber roller  is slipping, wipe it clean, or reduce the air pressure tension of th e unwinding 3.  Replace rubber roller . Problem :  Stand-up Hole Punch position varies occasionally during machine running. Potential R easons : 1.  Dancing Roller of Servo Motor swing in a large arc 2.  The  film is stretched 3.  The rubber roller slips Solution s : 1.  Reduce  the value of  servo tension, or  lift dancing  roller to reduce its swing range. 2.  Reduce heat sealing temperature . C heck whether servo -driven system  and  sealing system  are synchronized , make sure the  RH between main servo and lift system is close to 90° 3.  The hardness of rubber roller is too high and exceeds 75  degrees . Reduce the hardness of rubber roller  or  replace  a new one ;  check if there is contamination from dust or dirt  between the rubber roller and the film . Problem ： Machine stops abruptly during production. Potential R eason s : 1.  Machine speed is too high and voltage is unstable. 2.  The  RH  of th e  main motor  is  wrong,  p oor contact between hall switch and detection rod . 3.  The servo driver alarms . Solutions : 1.  Pulse of main servo driver should be set correctly and voltage value should be checked as well. 2.  Adjust the  RH between  lifting tool and the high-position Hall switch to90 °, adjust the Hall switch to align the signal detection rod.  3.  Check alarm codes one by one shown for all Servo Motors and out root cause. Problem : Machine is unable to start running. Potential Reasons : 1.  Servo system  error 2.  Computer signal interruption 3.  The main engine contactor is  faulty or t he  circuit controlled by the contactor fails 4.  PLC  system  alarm s Solution s : 1.  Check whether the servo system and the motor work normally. 2.  Connect the signal line. 3.  Replace the contactor. 4.  Check and  re- connect the circuit to eliminate error  alarm . Problem : The bag is  not  sealed  firmly Potential R eason s : 1.  Sealing bars are  uneven . 2.  The control circuit of the sealing  knife bars  is broken. 3.  T h ermocouple is damaged. 4.  P ressure of  sealing bars  is not big enough. Solution s : 1.  Grinding sealing bars  to make it smooth . 2.  Replace heating plate and check whether all curcuits are well connected. 3.  R epair or replace the thermocouple and the temperature control module . 4.  Adjust spring pressure of the sealing bars . Problem ：Film wrinkles when passing through the middle rubber roller. Potential Reasons : 1.  Back side of the film is not perfectly cooling down. 2.  Pressure of the middle rubber roller is uneven. 3.  Air pressure of the dancing roller is too large. 4.  There is too much dust on the surface of middle rubber roller. 5.  Sealing temperature is too high. Solutions: 1.  Reduce temperature of the chiller to promise chilling outcome. 2.  Check the air pressure on both sides of the rubber roller and adjust pressure accordingly. 3.  Reduce pressure of the dancing roller. 4.  Clean the rubber rollers. 5.  Reduce the heat sealing temperature of the sealing bars. Error between Setting Pouch Length and Real Pouch Length(along machine direction) Normally, real pouch length is decided by a united system including Sealing, Cutting and Film Feeding units, no matter with printing film or non-printing film. This system is functional based on different eye marks. If any error occurs among the system, real pouch length will be a little bit different from setting pouch length. Problem: The inaccurate photoelectric tracking during bag making Potential reasons: 1.  Photoelectric eye problem:  Improper selection of photoelectric eye adjustment method and working state. First of all, it is necessary to confirm whether the electric eye is adjusted well. Secondly, to confirm whether it is leading edge control or trailing edge control,  Finally, to confirm the tracking method, such as: scanning type, fixed-length check type. 2.  Cursor printing or spacing problems. 3.  Cursor design is unreasonable, the available scanning area is too narrow, and the contrast between the cursor and the surrounding area is not obvious. \n Beverage filling machines are the heart of any beverage production line, and their smooth operation is crucial for maintaining product quality, efficiency, and profitability. However, even the most well-maintained machines can experience issues that disrupt production and lead to costly downtime. In this article, we'll explore some of the most common problems encountered in beverage filling machines and provide practical solutions to help you keep your equipment running at peak performance. Well-functioning beverage filling machines are essential for ensuring consistent product quality, accurate fill levels, and efficient production. When issues arise, they can quickly lead to product waste, reduced output, and even potential safety hazards. By understanding the most common issues and their causes, operators and maintenance personnel can take proactive steps to prevent problems and minimize their impact on production. Filling Valve Issues Filling valves are critical components of any beverage filling machine, and their performance directly affects product quality and consistency. Some of the most common filling valve issues include: A. Leaking valves:   Leaks can occur due to worn seals, damaged O-rings, or improper valve assembly. To fix leaks, inspect and replace any worn or damaged parts, and ensure that valves are properly assembled and tightened. B. Inconsistent fill levels:   Clogged valves, pressure irregularities, or worn valve components can lead to inconsistent fill levels. Regular cleaning and maintenance of valves, as well as monitoring and adjusting pressure settings, can help maintain consistent filling performance. C. Valve timing problems:   Misaligned cams or worn cam followers can cause valves to open and close at the wrong times, leading to product waste and inconsistent filling\n…（共 15563 字，已读到 8000；接着读请用 offset=8000）"},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":""},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"H1rs1WUo6p9aXEy0Ejs6G7cpDlC4LxrX","function":{"index":0,"name":"fetch_url","arguments":{"url":"https://www.chovyting.com/industry-news/troubleshooting-tips-for-common-china-bag-making-machine-issues","offset":8000}}},{"id":"trnj8dyYcxMpmPRQ1dum8O4eQ85HIwDP","function":{"index":1,"name":"fetch_url","arguments":{"url":"https://cn.zhoutaimachine.com/index.php?m=home&c=View&a=index&aid=20"}}},{"id":"01PETgMABTIcNLPOnc8KlgCHNuE2HxYc","function":{"index":2,"name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"制袋机 光电纠偏 追踪 不准 光标 印刷 原因 处理"}}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":"enance ● Check PLC parameters \n● Inspect bearings \n● Test cooling systems \n● Tighten structural components \n● Replace worn parts Factories that follow regular maintenance schedules usually achieve much higher machine stability and lower maintenance costs. How Advanced China Bag Making Machines Reduce Downtime China bag making machine manufacturers have significantly improved automation, speed, and stability over the past decade. Modern Features Include ● Intelligent servo systems \n● Automatic tension control \n● Independent heating systems \n● EPC automatic alignment \n● Flying knife technology \n● Heavy-duty steel machine structure \n● Multi-line production systems These technologies help factories: ● Improve productivity \n● Reduce labor costs \n● Lower material waste \n● Increase sealing precision \n● Maintain stable high-speed production Why After-Sales Support Matters A professional bag making machine manufacturer should provide strong technical support and global service capabilities. Important Service Capabilities ● 24-hour online support \n● Overseas engineer service \n● Spare parts inventory \n● Installation and debugging \n● Operator training \n● Remote troubleshooting Reliable after-sales service can significantly reduce production interruptions and improve machine efficiency. Why Many Global Buyers Choose China Bag Making Machines China has become one of the world’s largest manufacturing centers for plastic bag making machinery. Main Advantages Competitive Pricing Chinese manufacturers offer cost-effective machinery compared with European equipment. Fast Technology Upgrades Many Chinese manufacturers continuously improve machine speed and automation. Comprehensive Product Range Modern manufacturers provide: ● Side sealing bag making machines \n● Bottom sealing bag making machines \n● Vest bag making machines \n● Garbage bag making machines \n● Zipper pouch making machines \n● FFS heavy-duty bag making machines Strong Customization Capability Machines can be customized for: ● Shopping bags \n● Courier bags \n● Medical packaging \n● Food packaging \n● Industrial packaging \n● Diaper packaging bags How Chovyting Machinery Improves Machine Stability As a professional China bag making machine manufacturer with over 25 years of industry experience, Chovyting Machinery focuses heavily on machine stability, precision, and automation. Key Advantages ● More than 100 patents \n● 50+ invention patents \n● 10,000㎡ production base \n● 180+ employees \n● Professional overseas technical team \n● CE-certified equipment \n● ISO quality management system Technical Strengths Chovyting’s machines feature: ● High-strength steel machine structures \n● Intelligent servo control systems \n● Advanced flying knife technology \n● Stable EPC tracking systems \n● High-speed production capability \n● Comprehensive bag-making solutions The company also provides global technical support and installation services in regions such as South America, the Middle East, Europe, Africa, and North America. Conclusion Troubleshooting common China bag making machine issues is essential for maintaining stable production, reducing waste, and improving factory profitability. Problems such as poor sealing, inaccurate bag length, film deviation, servo alarms, and cutting instability can often be solved through proper maintenance, parameter adjustment, and operator training. Modern China bag making machine manufacturers are continuously improving automation, precision, and production speed to meet global packaging demands. Choosing a reliable manufacturer with strong R&D capability, advanced technology, and professional after-sales support can greatly improve long-term production performance and machine reliability. For factories looking to increase efficiency and reduce downtime, investing in a high-quality automatic bag making machine is becoming increasingly important in the competitive global packaging industry. FAQ Why is my bag making machine not sealing correctly? Incorrect temperature settings, uneven pressure, worn sealing knives, or unstable film tension are common causes. What causes inaccurate bag length in bag making machines? Bag length problems are usually caused by EPC tracking issues, unstable film feeding, or servo synchronization errors. How often should a bag making machine be maintained? Daily cleaning and inspection are recommended, while deeper electrical and mechanical maintenance should be performed weekly and monthly. What is EPC in a bag making machine? EPC stands for Edge Position Control. It helps maintain accurate film alignment during production. Why does a servo motor alarm occur? Servo alarms may occur because of overload operation, voltage fluctuation, encoder communication failure, or incorrect PLC parameters. What is the advantage of flying knife systems? Flying knife systems improve cutting speed, sealing precision, and production efficiency while reducing waste. How can factories reduce bag production downtime? Preventive maintenance, operator training, stable machine structures, and professional after-sales support all help reduce downtime. Are China bag making machines suitable for global markets? Yes. Many China bag making machine manufacturers provide CE-certified equipment, overseas installation, and global technical support. \n Previous Post：\n How To Choose The Right Soft Loop Handle Bag Making Machine \n Next Post：\n Top Advantages of Buying Industrial Bag Making Machines from China Suppliers \n go back\n RECENT POSTS\n Fully Automatic Plastic Bag Making Machine: How To Reduce Material Waste \n How To Compare Plastic Bag Making Machine Manufacturers Before Buying \n How To Choose The Right Ziplock Bag Making Machine For Your Packaging Business \n Top Factors to Consider When Buying an Industrial Bag Making Machine \n How To Improve Production Efficiency Of Wicket Bag Making Machine \n CATEGORIES\n Corporate news \n Exhibition News \n Industry News Our Professional Team Will Be At Your Service 24 Hours A Day \n Contact Us \n CHOVYTING is a manufacturer specialized in the design and production of plastic bag making machine. \n Facebook-f \n Youtube \n Tiktok \n Whatsapp \n QuickLine Home Products About R&D Videos Service Blog Solution Projects Franchise Contact Product Plastic Bag Making Machine Laminated Pouch Making Machine Series FFS Industry Heavy Duty Bag Making Machine Series Auxiliary equipment Quick Contact If you have any questions or need help, feel free to contact with our team. \n +86-13958813143 \n [email protected] \n No. 518, Yuanhang Road, Gexiang New District, Nanbin Street, Ruian City, Zhejiang Province \n Zhejiang Chovyting machinery Co.，Ltd | Support By :JUNJ| Sitemap.xml Inquiry WhatsApp:+8613958813143 × Subject Message Send GET A QUOTE NOW \n Name \n Email * \n Phone \n Company \n Message * \n Send"},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":"制袋机技术难点及解决办法部分剖析_上海洲泰轻工机械制造有限公司 \n 中文简体 \n English \n Español \n Pусский \n Türkçe \n Bahasa Indonesia \n العربية \n Português \n 网站首页 \n 关于我们 \n 公司简介 \n 业务范围 \n 技术研发 \n 产品中心 \n 制袋机 \n 八边封/方底袋 \n 多功能自立袋 \n 中封/四边封袋 \n 辅助机器 \n 无溶剂复合机 \n 封管机 \n 行业应用 \n 液体包装 \n 综合液体包装 \n 盒中袋 \n 直嘴/斜嘴机 \n 宠物食品包装 \n 平底袋 \n 四边封袋（带拉链/把手/一片膜） \n 自立袋（湿粮） \n 工业包装 \n 精细化工包装 \n 真空袋 \n 医疗包装 \n 数码包装 \n 产品服务 \n 区域服务 \n 服务支持 \n 演示中心 \n 新闻中心 \n 公司新闻 \n 联系我们 \n Lanuage\n 中文简体 \n English \n 公司新闻 \n 首页 > 新闻中心 > 公司新闻 \n 新闻中心 \n > 公司新闻 \n 推荐产品 \n AMD450FSL-S \n 改良型方底袋制袋机 \n AMD650FSL-S13 \n 改良型方底拉链袋制袋机 \n AMD100-SI-ZX \n 制袋机技术难点及解决办法部分剖析 \n Views : \n Update time : 2024-10-10 \n 当我们使用制袋机时可能会遇到一些问题，怎么解决这些问题呢，今天向大家介绍一些普遍问题以及解决方法。 一、白袋长度有长短 可能原因: 1、伺服牵引张力不好; 2、拖料拉不动 ; 3、橡胶棍存在直径误差 解决办法: 1、调整伺服牵引曲线; 2、检查胶辊是否打滑，擦拭干净，或者减小放料气压张力; 3、更换胶辊 二、自立白立袋冲孔跑动误差太大，超过2mm 可能原因：1、伺服牵引浮动滚筒摆动幅度过大，跳动厉害; 2、薄膜拉伸; 3、胶辊打滑 解决办法：1、减少伺服张力补偿系数值，或者把浮动滚筒上抬减少其摆动范围; 2、降低薄膜热封温度，同时检查伺服牵引和烫压是否同步，若不同步调整主伺服抬刀角度，尽量保证其与高位信号角度为90度正负接近; 3、胶辊硬度太高超过75度，降低胶辊硬度更换新的胶辊；检查胶辊和薄膜之间是否有粉尘，擦拭干净 三、制袋时常停机 可能原因:1、主机速度过快，电压不稳； 2、主机霍尔信号角度不对，或者接触不良； 3、伺服驱动器报警 解决办法:1、主伺服驱动器设置正确的脉冲，检查伺服变压器电压； 2、调整抬刀和高位霍尔开关至正确位置90度，调整霍尔开关对正信号检测杆； 3、查看伺服驱动器对应报警代码逐个排除 四、主机不能启动 可能原因:1、伺服系统故障； 2、电脑信号中断； 3、主机接触器坏或接触器控制电路不通； 4、PLC出错报警 解决办法:1、检查伺服系统与电机工作是否正常； 2、接好信号线； 3、更换接触器； 4、检查接通其控制电路，消除PLC故障出错报警 五、热封刀封口不牢 可能原因:1、封刀不平整； 2、封刀加热控制断路； 3、控制电路或热电偶损坏； 4、烫刀压力不够 ； 解决办法:1、封刀上磨床磨平整； 2、更换电热板，检查其连接线； 3、检查修理或更换热电偶，更换温控模块； 4、调整封刀弹簧压力 七、过中间胶辊时袋子皱 可能原因：1、背封冷却效果不好； 2、中间胶辊压力不均匀； 3、浮动滚筒气压过大； 4、中间胶辊上灰尘过多； 5、热封温度过高 解决办法：1、增加冷水机制冷效果，降低冷水机温度；2、看看胶辊两边气压根据薄膜特性调整左右大小压力； 3、降低浮动滚筒压力； 4、擦拭胶辊； 5、降低烫刀热封温度 七、制袋机制袋长度定长系统误差过大 制袋长度分为空白袋定长和印刷定长，这两类定长系统都是由热封、切刀联动系统和走膜系统组成的，通过电眼联系在一起协调工作。如果联动或协调产生误差，就会引起与制袋长度相关的尺寸偏差。 重点讲解电眼跟踪不准。跟踪不准的原因有以下几点: 1、电眼问题:光电眼调整方法及工作状态选择不当。 首先要确认电眼是否调好，电眼反射及透射选择是否正确，其次要确认前沿控制还是后沿控制，即所谓极性，还要确认跟踪方式，如:扫描式(即先走完定长，然后扫描色标)、定长查位式(即走完定长后查一下是否有色标，是过头了还是没有到位)； 2、光标印制或间距问题； 3、光标设计不合理、可用的扫描区过于狭窄、光标与周围区域对比不明显； 4、光标间距有变化 \n Previous : 无溶剂复合在烟包领域的应用 \n Next : 可持续性包装的必然性 \n 推荐展会 \n Read More >> \n 如果您对我们的产品有建议或需求，请给我们留下宝贵的建议 ! \n 在线留言 \n 上海洲泰轻工机械制造有限公司 \n 地址：上海市青浦区华新镇新协路1253号 \n 电话：0086-021-69792345 \n 邮箱： info@zhoutaimachine.com \n 浙江洲泰机械有限公司 \n 地址：浙江省湖州市南浔经济开发区向阳西路2088号 \n 电话：0572-3057980 \n 产品中心 \n 制袋机 \n 无溶剂复合机 \n 封管机 \n 行业应用 \n 液体包装 \n 宠物食品包装 \n 工业包装 \n 医疗包装 \n 数码包装 \n Follow \n 微信二维码 \n 抖音二维码 \n Copyright © 2024-2028上海洲泰轻工机械制造有限公司 All rights reserved \n 网站首页 \n 关于我们 \n 产品中心 \n 行业应用 \n 产品服务 \n 新闻中心 \n 联系我们 \n Send Email \n Skype Chat \n Send Inquiry \n LiveChat 关闭 \n Leave Your Message \n Hit enter to search or ESC to close"},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"web_search","content":"（来源: tavily）\n1. 美亚光电近6年商业秘密侵权纠纷落幕：侵权方已成失信公司，近2亿元赔偿或难“落袋”\n   https://cn.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/article-3153923\n   本网站的广告客户可能会根据您与广告或广告主的互动情况，向Fusion Media支付费用。   \n 本协议的英文版本系主要版本。如英文版本与中文版本存在差异，以英文版本为准。 [...] 市场资讯 \n\n市场资讯 \n       外汇\n       商品&期货\n       股市\n       经济指标\n       财经\n       加密货币\n       财经要闻\n       Pro资讯\n\n\n2. 光电工程 - 维基百科，自由的百科全书\n   https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-hans/%E5%85%89%E9%9B%BB%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B\n   编辑链接\n\n 条目\n 讨论\n\n 不转换\n 简体\n 繁體\n 大陆简体\n 香港繁體\n 澳門繁體\n 大马简体\n 新加坡简体\n 臺灣正體\n\n 阅读\n 编辑\n 查看历史\n\n工具\n\n操作\n\n 阅读\n 编辑\n 查看历史\n\n常规\n\n 链入页面\n 相关更改\n 上传文件\n 固定链接\n 页面信息\n 引用此页\n 获取短链接\n\n打印/导出\n\n 下载为PDF\n 可打印版; \"本页面的可打印版本​[p]\")\n\n在其他项目中\n\n\n3. 首页 - 中国科学院大学材料科学与光电技术学院\n   https://cmo.ucas.ac.cn/index.php/zh-cn\n   Internet Explorer is missing updates required to properly view this site. Click here to update…\n 您的浏览器已禁用JavaScript,(da)启(kai)用才能正常访问！\n\n# 材料科学与光电技术学院 材料科学与光电技术学院 中国科学院大学材料科学与光电技术学院 中国科学院大学材料科学与光电技术学院 \n4. 光电工程\n   https://www.oejournal.org/oee\n   ### 审稿导读MORE\n\n### 新闻\n\n 期刊\n\n## 导出文件\n\n#### 文件类别\n\n